     A**********************************************************
     A* WDEAP_HLD - REVERSE-ENGINEERED stub (held batch file).
     A* Real Sapiens source not in QDDSSRC drop.
     A*
     A* WDEAP_HLD's data structure is loaded right after WDEHP in
     A* SPRtrigger.rpgle, and WDEHP already supplies EHCO#/EHFND/
     A* EHFYR (with the same EH prefix). Including those here
     A* produces RNF3804 sev-30 "duplicate field" errors that stop
     A* the compile.  Stub holds only the fields downstream code
     A* uses that AREN'T also defined in WDEHP.
     A*
     A* Real production WDEAP_HLD presumably has the full schema;
     A* RPG's behaviour with collisions varies by compile options.
     A**********************************************************
     A          R PEHHLD                    TEXT('EMPLOYER A/R HOLD')
     A            EHCASE         9P 0       TEXT('Case #')
     A            EHEOB#         5P 0       TEXT('EOB #')
     A            EHSUB#         3P 0       TEXT('Sub #')
